### ─── Variables ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api/v1

# After running "Register buyer" below, paste the returned usertoken here:
@buyerToken = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

# After running "Register admin (manual seed)" and logging in, paste here:
@adminToken = PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE

# After running "Admin: list users", paste a userId here:
@targetUserId = PASTE_USER_ID_HERE


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### REGISTER
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Register a buyer
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Aysha Siddika",
  "email": "aysha@test.com",
  "phone": "01712345678",
  "password": "Password123",
  "role": "buyer"
}

###

### Register a seller
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ahmed Rahman",
  "email": "ahmed@restaurant.com",
  "phone": "01812345678",
  "password": "Password123",
  "role": "seller",
  "restaurantName": "Ahmed's Kitchen"
}

###

### Register a rider
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Karim Hossain",
  "email": "karim@rider.com",
  "phone": "01912345678",
  "password": "Password123",
  "role": "rider",
  "vehicleType": "Motorcycle"
}

###

### Register — validation error (missing name)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "invalid@test.com",
  "password": "123"
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### LOGIN
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Login buyer
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "aysha@test.com",
  "password": "Password123"
}

###

### Login with role hint (must match registered role)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "aysha@test.com",
  "password": "Password123",
  "role": "buyer"
}

###

### Login — wrong password (expect 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "aysha@test.com",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

###

### Login — role mismatch (expect 403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "aysha@test.com",
  "password": "Password123",
  "role": "seller"
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### PROFILE (authenticated)
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### GET my profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}

###

### PATCH my profile — update name and phone
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}

{
  "name": "Aysha Updated",
  "phone": "01799999999"
}

###

### PATCH — attempt role escalation (should be ignored server-side)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}

{
  "role": "admin"
}

###

### GET /me without token (expect 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### ADMIN ENDPOINTS
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Admin — list all users
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### Admin — list buyers only
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/admin/users?role=buyer
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### Admin — list sellers only
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/admin/users?role=seller
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### Admin — toggle user active/inactive
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/auth/admin/users/{{targetUserId}}/toggle
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### Admin endpoint with buyer token (expect 403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### HEALTH CHECK
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

GET http://localhost:5000/health
